   "shrinkage_only_centred": "eps_centred*B + 0.5*eps_centred**2*W; the shift-invariant one-scalar summary",
   "shrinkage_only_prediction": "eps_hat*B + 0.5*eps_hat**2*W; the whole displacement summarised by one scalar",
